From 94acd25770fa4b121fb25a9c90f454b08166a40c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:13:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/15] test-posix: Check <math.h>'s macros, constants,
 prototypes and namespace

test-math_h checks float_t and double_t, the classification macros,
HUGE_VAL and friends, FP_FAST_FMA*, FP_ILOGB0 and FP_ILOGBNAN,
MATH_ERRNO, MATH_ERREXCEPT and math_errhandling, every M_ constant's
type and value, signgam and each prototype. test-math_h-names checks
that strict POSIX sees no XSI or extension names.

Signed-off-by: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
---
